      "line_num": 81,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Replace the floating delivery milestone with a real anchor. The \"4-month\" figure was the customer's own arbitrary soon-ish and cannot be met or missed as written.**\n`TODO.md:L81`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 360,
      "y": 1410
    },
    {
