      "tags": [],
      "text": "**4. Job queue \u2014 last on purpose. The demo is staged-and-labelled and November needs no software, so nothing forces real proactive nudges until the configs and features have landed. Promote it when a staged beat has to become a real one.**\n`TODO.md:L95`",
