      "text": "**`make caprover_app_create APP=<name>` wrapper: One Makefile call to register a new CapRover app via the HTTP API (`/api/v2/user/apps/appDefinitions/register`), POST the env-var block, set the persistent volume path, and connect a custom domain. Driver: avoid the dashboard click-through we did for `try-sage-is` on `captain.example.com` 2026-05-01.**\n`TODO.md:L138`",
