      ],
      "text": "**Sprigs admin UI redesign (`app/src/lib/components/admin/Sprigs.svelte`): group cards by capability; collapse the six embedding cultivars into one \"Embedding\" choice with a cultivar picker; disclose consequences BEFORE Graft/Prune (size, restart-required, \"replaces X\" / \"this breaks document search\"); hide `pid`/`base_url`; explain the Sprig/Graft/Prune/Wilted metaphor inline (tooltip or docs link); add first-run guidance instead of a wall of 14 cards.**\n`#bonsai`\n`TODO.md:L237`",
