      "text": "**2.4 ML Bundle (signed per-arch \u00d7 per-accel): Replace the 2.3.1 transitional ML wizard path (runtime `uv pip install` + `sitecustomize.py`) with signed tarball bundles published on GitHub Releases. Wizard pulls via `curl | sha256sum -c | tar -xz`; `distribution.env` carries `ML_BUNDLE_TAG` + per-variant SHA256s. Bring CUDA back as a first-class matrix cell. `requirements-ml.lock` from 2.3.1 is the build input \u2014 no thrown-away work. Plan: `~/.claude/plans/given-our-newest-trends-modular-sloth.md`.**\n`TODO.md:L304`",
